sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Menu
    participant Validation
    participant Expense
    participant FileManager
    participant CSV

    User->>Menu: Select Add New Expense
    Menu->>Validation: Validate amount/category/date/description
    Validation-->>Menu: Validated values
    Menu->>Expense: Create Expense
    Expense-->>Menu: Expense object
    Menu->>FileManager: Save expenses
    FileManager->>CSV: Write records
    CSV-->>FileManager: Save complete
    FileManager-->>Menu: Success
    Menu-->>User: Expense added
